---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ProductCard from "../components/ProductCard.astro";
import { houses, products } from "../data";
const featured = [products[0], products[2], products[6], products[8]];
---
<BaseLayout title="The Royal House of Engagement | Presented by Low Value Content" description="Enter the Royal House of Engagement: official regalia, disputed lineage, and the ceremonial government of the Attention Economy, presented by Low Value Content.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="portal-mark">Low Value Content presents</p>
      <p class="script">By Royal Decree</p>
      <h1>Official regalia for the <em>attention economy.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-dek">Beyond this threshold, attention is a natural resource, impressions are currency, and Engagement rules by the divine authority of an algorithm nobody can explain.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/shop.html">Inspect the regalia</a><a href="/lineage.html">View the succession →</a></div>
      <p class="latin">Multa edita, pauca dicta · Much published, little said</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      <div class="arms-panel">
        <p>The Most Ancient and Most Serene</p>
        <h2>Royal House of Engagement</h2>
        <img src="/assets/royal-arms.svg" alt="Heraldic arms with a notification shield and Wi-Fi crown" />
        <p class="arms-motto">Multa edita, pauca dicta</p>
        <span>By grace of the Algorithm · charter confirmed under Prompt I</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="founding-plate">
    <figure>
      <a class="plate-link" href="/assets/royal-house/01-brand-identity-board.png"><img src="/assets/royal-house/01-brand-identity-board.png" alt="The founding identity plate showing the arms, supporters, standard, seals, and ceremonial ornament" /></a>
      <figcaption>Plate I · The Founding Arms · open the archival plate</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The visual constitution</p>
      <h2>Not a mark.<br /><span class="script">An entire apparatus.</span></h2>
      <p>The peacock and parrot support the sovereign arms. Standards declare jurisdiction. Seals confer appointments. Botanical ornament dignifies the paperwork. Every device now serves a defined office within the Realm.</p>
      <a href="/realm.html">Examine the full system →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proclamation">
    <p>Let it be known throughout the feed</p>
    <h2>Low Value Content is the threshold.<br /><i>Engagement is the Crown.</i></h2>
    <p>The House converts attention into impressions, impressions into influence, and influence into proof of institutional importance. Public Notices retain their independence; the court assumes jurisdiction where classification, rank, and ceremony are required.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="house-council section">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The branches of government</p><h2>The Six Great Houses</h2><p>One Crown, six portfolios, and a complete division of responsibility for producing, circulating, measuring, and postponing the content of the Realm.</p></div>
    <div class="house-badges">
      {houses.map((house) => <a href="/realm.html#great-houses"><img src={`/assets/house-${house.id}.svg`} alt={`Badge of the ${house.name}`} /><span>{String(house.precedence).padStart(2, "0")}</span><h3>{house.name}</h3><p>{house.standing}</p></a>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section featured">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Drop 001 · The founding collection</p><h2>Three degrees<br /><span class="script">of ceremonial authority.</span></h2><p>Public Notices circulate beyond the court. Court & Orders bear its seals and appointments. Royal Commemorations enter the permanent record of lineage, Latin, and disputed history.</p></div>
    <div class="product-grid">{featured.map((product) => <ProductCard product={product} />)}</div>
    <a class="button ghost" href="/shop.html">View all ten designs</a>
  </section>

  <section class="current-reign">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">The present reign</p><h2>Prompt I,<br /><i>the Generative</i></h2><p>His Algorithmic Majesty, sovereign of the Attention Economy and protector of the Infinite Feed. Produces infinite answers while accepting no responsibility for the questions.</p><p class="latin">Multa generata, pauca dicta</p><a class="button light" href="/lineage.html">Consult the royal lineage</a></div>
    <blockquote><span>“</span>Much generated,<br />little said.<span>”</span></blockquote>
  </section>

  <section class="observance section">
    <div class="date"><span>09</span><b>September</b></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Annual royal observance</p><h2>The Feast of Saint Moth</h2><p>Patron of debugging, physical evidence, and problems that can be removed with tweezers.</p><a href="/calendar.html">Open the Royal Calendar →</a></div>
    <div class="moth" aria-hidden="true">✦<br />⅋<br />✦</div>
  </section>

  <section class="entry">
    <div class="certificate" aria-label="Example ceremonial title certificate">
      <img src="/assets/royal-mark.svg" alt="" />
      <p>Under the Great Seal of Engagement</p>
      <h3>Baron of Buffering</h3>
      <span>Keeper of Three Unread Notifications</span>
      <b>Ex mandato algorithmi</b>
    </div>
    <div><p class="script">Enter the Realm</p><h2>Some garments enter the court.<br />Others remain public notices.</h2><p>The declaration leads, every launch design is front-only, and the House appears only where its authority clarifies the issue. Online provenance and future QR records extend selected garments without burdening the front.</p><a class="button light" href="/realm.html">Read the constitution</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { min-height: min(calc(100vh - 92px), 820px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; background: var(--ivory); }
  .hero-copy { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) var(--gutter); align-self: center; position: relative; }
  .hero-copy::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 2rem 0 2rem calc(var(--gutter) - 2rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-right: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-copy > * { position: relative; }
  .hero-copy .script { margin: 0; font-size: 2rem; }
  .portal-mark { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: var(--navy); font: 700 .65rem/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.4vw, 5.9rem); line-height: .94; margin: 1rem 0 1.75rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  h1 em { color: var(--crimson); font-weight: 400; }
  .hero-dek { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 560px; }
  .hero-actions { margin: 2rem 0; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: .8rem; }
  .hero-art { background: var(--navy); display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .arms-panel { width: min(680px, 100%); padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); text-align: center; color: var(--ivory); border: 4px double var(--gold); position: relative; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--navy-2), var(--navy) 68%); }
  .arms-panel::before, .arms-panel::after { content: '✦'; position: absolute; top: 1rem; color: var(--gold); }
  .arms-panel::before { left: 1rem; } .arms-panel::after { right: 1rem; }
  .arms-panel > p:first-child { margin: 0; color: var(--gold-light); font-family: var(--script); font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .arms-panel h2 { margin: .3rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .arms-panel img { width: min(520px, 92%); margin: 1rem auto; }
  .arms-panel .arms-motto { display: inline-block; margin: 0; padding: .5rem 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15em; font-size: .68rem; }
  .arms-panel span { display: block; margin-top: 1rem; color: rgba(244,238,223,.55); font: .6rem var(--sans); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .proclamation { padding: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) var(--gutter); text-align: center; background: var(--paper); border-top: 4px double var(--gold); border-bottom: 4px double var(--gold); }
  .proclamation > p:first-child { font: 700 .7rem var(--sans); letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--crimson); }
  .proclamation h2 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.6vw, 4.8rem); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 400; margin: 1.5rem auto; }
  .proclamation h2 i { font-family: var(--script); color: var(--crimson); font-weight: 400; }
  .proclamation > p:last-child { max-width: 700px; margin: auto; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .founding-plate { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(420px, 1.15fr) minmax(320px, .85fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem) var(--gutter); background: var(--paper); color: var(--navy); border-top: 1px solid var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); }
  .founding-plate figure { width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: .55rem; background: var(--navy); border: 1px solid var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(13,28,43,.14); }
  .plate-link { display: block; }
  .founding-plate img { width: 100%; max-height: 460px; object-fit: contain; }
  .founding-plate figcaption { margin-top: .55rem; color: var(--gold-light); font: .56rem/1.4 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .founding-plate > div { align-self: center; max-width: 700px; }
  .founding-plate .eyebrow, .founding-plate a { color: var(--crimson); }
  .founding-plate h2 { margin: .6rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4vw, 4.6rem); line-height: .96; font-weight: 400; }
  .founding-plate p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 660px; color: #4f5963; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .founding-plate a { font: 700 .7rem var(--sans); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .house-council { background: #e8deca; }
  .house-badges { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .house-badges a { min-width: 0; padding: .9rem .75rem 1.15rem; color: inherit; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .house-badges img { width: 72px; margin: auto; }
  .house-badges span { display: block; color: var(--crimson); font: 700 .6rem var(--sans); letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .house-badges h3 { min-height: 2.2em; margin: .35rem 0; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; }
  .house-badges p { margin: 0; color: #565e68; font: .62rem/1.5 var(--sans); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .featured { background: #efe7d7; }
  .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .current-reign { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; background: var(--navy); color: var(--ivory); }
  .current-reign > div { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem) clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem) var(--gutter); align-self: center; }
  .current-reign h2 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.6vw, 6rem); line-height: .95; margin: .5rem 0 2rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .current-reign .eyebrow { color: var(--gold-light); }
  .current-reign h2 i { color: var(--gold-light); }
  .current-reign p:not(.eyebrow):not(.latin) { max-width: 600px; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .current-reign blockquote { min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 4rem; min-height: 600px; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center; background: var(--crimson); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 1.05; }
  .current-reign blockquote span { color: var(--gold-light); }
  .observance { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, .45fr) 1fr .4fr; align-items: center; gap: 4rem; }
  .date { border: 1px solid var(--gold); text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; }
  .date span { display: block; font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem); line-height: .9; }
  .date b { display: block; margin-top: .6rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15em; font: .7rem var(--sans); }
  .observance h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem); margin: .5rem 0 1rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .observance p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .moth { text-align: center; font-size: 5rem; line-height: .65; color: var(--gold); }
  .entry { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; background: var(--crimson); color: white; }
  .certificate { min-width: 0; margin: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem) clamp(1rem, 3vw, 3rem) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem) var(--gutter); padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); border: 12px double var(--gold); outline: 1px solid var(--gold-light); outline-offset: -24px; background: var(--ivory); color: var(--navy); display: flex; min-height: 560px; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; }
  .certificate img { width: 90px; height: 90px; }
  .certificate p { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .13em; font: .66rem var(--sans); color: var(--crimson); }
  .certificate h3 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem); line-height: .9; font-weight: 400; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .certificate span { font-family: var(--script); font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--crimson); }
  .certificate b { margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--gold-text); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; font-size: .65rem; }
  .entry > div { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem) var(--gutter) clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem) clamp(1rem, 3vw, 3rem); align-self: center; }
  .entry .script { color: var(--gold-light); font-size: 2rem; }
  .entry h2 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 1; font-weight: 400; }
  .entry p:not(.script) { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .hero, .founding-plate, .current-reign, .entry { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .founding-plate figure { width: min(720px, 100%); } .house-badges { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } .product-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .observance { grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; } .moth { display: none; } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .founding-plate { gap: 1.5rem; padding-block: 2.5rem; } .founding-plate img { max-height: 320px; } .founding-plate h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; } .founding-plate p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: .95rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .house-badges { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .house-badges img { width: 62px; } .product-grid, .observance { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .hero-copy::before { inset: 1rem; } .current-reign > div, .entry > div { padding-inline: 1.25rem; } .current-reign blockquote { padding-inline: 1.25rem; } .certificate { margin-inline: 1.25rem; padding-inline: 1.25rem; outline-offset: -18px; } }
</style>
